        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_e120334_1499417193021_669719_23403"/>
        <body>An AssemblyShapeJoint is a type of PartShapeElement that defines a joint between two or more OccurrenceShapeFeatures within an AssemblyDefinition. An AssemblyShapeJoint may be composed of other AssemblyShapeJoints. </body>
